Workflow "untrap-main-flow" (Main flow) connects 20 screen(s).
Implement the router so every link in this workflow navigates source screen -> target screen on its trigger. Preserve back-stack behaviour: the back button returns to the previous screen.', '2026-11-03 12:44:44', '2026-11-05 02:16:35', 1, 'public', 1, NULL, 8, 1, 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "workflows" ("id", "key", "name", "label", "description_dev", "created_at", "updated_at", "project_id", "visibility", "creator_id", "cloned_from_id", "root_item_id", "root_owner_id", "locked") VALUES (9, 'authentication', 'Authentication', 'Authentication', 'Splash, sign in, sign up and Google sign-in.
Workflow "authentication" (Authentication) connects 5 screen(s).
Implement the router so every link in this workflow navigates source screen -> target screen on its trigger. Preserve back-stack behaviour: the back button returns to the previous screen.', '2026-11-03 12:44:44', '2026-11-03 12:44:44', 1, 'public', 1, NULL, 9, 1, 0);
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO "workflows" ("id", "key", "name", "label", "description_dev", "created_at", "updated_at", "project_id", "visibility", "creator_id", "cloned_from_id", "root_item_id", "root_owner_id", "locked") VALUES (10, 'document-actions', 'Document actions', 'Document actions', 'The four document screens: main button, radial actions, bottom actions and share ring.
Workflow "document-actions" (Document actions) connects 4 screen(s).
Implement the router so every link in this workflow navigates source screen -> target screen on its trigger. Preserve back-stack behaviour: the back button returns to the previous screen.', '2026-11-03 12:44:44', '2026-11-03 12:44:44', 1, 'public', 1, NULL, 10, 1, 0);
